Day 6 — Azure Monitoring + Logging + Alerting (Azure Monitor Stack)

STAR-based DevOps Interview Questions

1️⃣ Your production application shows random latency spikes. How will you design monitoring using Azure Monitor metrics, logs, and alerts?

2️⃣ Logs are scattered across Azure VMs, AKS, and App Services. How will you centralize and correlate them effectively?

3️⃣ You need alerts only when an error condition persists for 10 minutes, not for transient spikes. How will you configure alert rules?

4️⃣ A security incident occurred and you must identify who deleted a resource and from where. Which Azure logs will you check?

5️⃣ Application Insights is generating too much telemetry and cost is rising. How will you optimize data collection without losing visibility?

6️⃣ You want end-to-end transaction tracing across microservices running on AKS and App Services. How will you design this?

7️⃣ Alerts are firing too frequently, causing alert fatigue for on-call engineers. How will you reduce noise while keeping reliability high?

8️⃣ Different teams need access to logs of only their own applications. How will you design RBAC and log access control?

9️⃣ You must create a single dashboard showing CPU, memory, latency, error rate, and request count for leadership review. How will you build it?

🔟 You need proactive detection of anomalies in performance metrics. Which Azure monitoring features will you enable?

1️⃣1️⃣ Logs must be retained for 1 year for compliance, but only 30 days for operational use. How will you design retention policies?

1️⃣2️⃣ An AKS cluster is experiencing pod restarts, but no alerts are triggered. How will you detect and alert on this scenario?

1️⃣3️⃣ You want to export logs to an external SIEM or storage account. How will you configure diagnostic settings?

1️⃣4️⃣ A cloud-native app must emit structured logs with correlation IDs. How will you implement this using Azure services?

1️⃣5️⃣ You need synthetic monitoring to check availability of internal and external endpoints. How will you configure this in Azure?
